Input
Store opt
Input
Store A
Input
Store B

Load opt

// 4: División
Subt FOUR
SkipCond 0C00
Jump div
Add FOUR
// 3: Multiplicación
Subt THREE
SkipCond 0C00
Jump mult
Add THREE
// 2: Resta
subt TWO
SkipCond 0C00
Jump sub
Add TWO
// 1: Suma
subt ONE
SkipCond 0C00
Jump sum
Add ONE
// Opción inválida -> regresar 0
Load ZERO
Store total
Jump result

// SUMA
sum, Load A
Add B
Store total
Jump result

// RESTA
sub, Load A
Subt B
Store total
Jump result

// MULTIPLICACIÓN
mult, Load B
SkipCond 000
Jump mult_pos

Load ZERO
Subt A
Store A

Load ZERO
Subt B
Store B

mult_pos, Load B
SkipCond 800
Jump total

mult_loop, Load total
Add A
Store total
Load B
Subt ONE
Store B
SkipCond 400
Jump mult_loop
Jump result

// DIVISIÓN
div, Load A
SkipCond 000
Jump div_checkB
Load ZERO
Subt A
Store A
Load ONE
Store negA

div_checkB, Load B
SkipCond 000
Jump div_loop
Load ZERO
Subt B
Store B
Load ONE
Store negB

div_loop, Load A
Subt B
SkipCond 000
Jump restar
Jump div_sign

restar, Store A
Load total
Add ONE
Store total
Jump div_loop

div_sign, Load negA
Subt negB
SkipCond 0C00
Jump result

Load ZERO
Subt total
Store total

// RESULTADO
result, Load total
Output
Halt

// DEFINICIONES
opt, DEC 0
A, DEC 0
B, DEC 0
total, DEC 0
negA, DEC 0
negB, DEC 0

ZERO, DEC 0
ONE, DEC 1
TWO, DEC 2
THREE, DEC 3
FOUR, DEC 4